"P3411790373" "Poison Drums"
// DetailString :
"P3421472500" "According to the workers, the Resistance intercepted their pumping team and plan on adding a lethal neuro-toxin to the chemical additives. If they succeed then the public will believe that the chemical additives were to blame."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EmptyDrumsClue 
