// Clue Name :
"P253092141" "Drums are Empty"
// DetailString :
"P1461371414" "You checked the drums of neuro-toxin but they were all empty, they must already be in the injector lines. You need to stop the chemical pump before they make it into the main lines!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
