// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1676878301" "Chemical Pumping Device"
// DetailString :
"P3063685368" "You deactivated the chemical pump and almost immediately the Resistance reacted. From the looks of it they're headed to the Main Pump. They must be trying to activate and then destory the main valve controls so you can't stop the poison from getting into the water supply!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MainPumpClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2109760568" "Main Pump Saved"
// DetailString :
"P3207562992" "After dectivating the chemical pump the Resistance made every effort to try and destroy the main pump valve which controls the flow for pumping water through the Praetorian waterworks. Obviously they felt threatened, and thanks to your efforts they won't be tampering with the water supply anytime soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
